Description: Remove redundant Utility desktop category
 The Development category is sufficient for Fresh, which is a
 text editor. Keeping Utility as a second main category can cause
 the application to appear more than once in application menus.
Author: Damian Daniel <damian@danielovci.net>
Forwarded: https://github.com/sinelaw/fresh/pull/3809
Last-Update: 2026-11-18

--- a/crates/fresh-editor/resources/fresh.desktop
+++ b/crates/fresh-editor/resources/fresh.desktop
@@ -7,7 +7,7 @@ Exec=fresh %F
 Icon=fresh
 Terminal=true
 Type=Application
-Categories=Development;TextEditor;Utility;
+Categories=Development;TextEditor;
 Keywords=editor;terminal;text;code;programming;lsp;
 MimeType=text/plain;text/x-csrc;text/x-chdr;text/x-c++src;text/x-c++hdr;text/x-java;text/x-python;text/x-script.python;application/x-python;text/x-rust;text/x-go;text/javascript;application/javascript;text/x-typescript;application/json;text/html;text/css;text/x-shellscript;text/x-lua;text/x-ruby;text/x-php;text/x-csharp;text/markdown;
 StartupNotify=false

